# 5. New Microservice: Plate Recognition

We add a new service.

```text
plate_service/

config.py
stream_reader.py
plate_detector.py
ocr_reader.py
main.py
```

Architecture:

```text
tracked_objects stream
      │
      ▼
Plate Recognition Service
      │
      ▼
vehicle_identity stream
```

